WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Start from a completed origination. Review the risk package and its source references. All records in this walkthrough are synthetic.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Follow the associated documents. The Documents tab lists submitted evidence and its status. Open a row to inspect the record.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Distinguish metadata from the original file. The record includes type, size and identifiers. Download file retrieves the original; Export metadata does not.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Inspect the integrations behind the result. Review each source, its data availability and last sync. A Connected status does not mean complete coverage.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Check connection health and context. This synthetic bank connection has no coverage summary. Missing values are not evidence that a check passed.

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Compare the identifiers in API response. Use the borrower, connection, document and risk-package IDs to follow the evidence across records.

7
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Read the field definitions when needed. Data Lookup explains normalized fields. Keep source facts, derived measurements and conclusions distinct.
